# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files
# Repo-wide ignores (node_modules, dist, .expo, expo-env.d.ts, ios, android, .env.*, .DS_Store)
# live in the root .gitignore. Only Expo-specific extras are kept here.

# Expo
web-build/

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

*.pem

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
